# Mobile-Only Bottom Nav Tabs (Live · Giving · Buy Seeds)

These bottom-menu destinations must stay **mobile-scripted only**. Music and Home have separate lock rules.

## Routes

| Tab | Path | Mobile-only rule |
|-----|------|------------------|
| Live | `/live` | Holding room + Viewer POV use mobile layout only — no `md:` / `lg:` desktop shell swap |
| Giving | `/giving`, `/experience/giving` | Single 853×1844 artboard capped to `--mobile-app-track-w` |
| Buy Seeds | `/buy-seeds` | Single 853×1844 artboard capped to `--mobile-app-track-w` |

## Forbidden unless operator explicitly requests and reconfirms

- `hidden lg:block` / `md:hidden` viewport splits for alternate desktop UIs
- Full-bleed desktop stretch (`width: 100%` + `100vw` + `object-fit: cover`) on artboard pages
- Reintroducing `ViewerPovGoLiveDesktop`, desktop giving overlays, or desktop buy-seeds layouts
- Phone-frame clamps (`max-w-md`, `max-w-[430px]`) on primary wrappers

## Allowed pattern (match Music tab)

- `justify-content: center` page shell
- Stage: `width: var(--mobile-app-track-w)` + `object-fit: contain`
- Percentage hotspot overlays on the PNG — do not move without new art
